{"id":"bozak","name":"Bozak","type":"character","aliases":["Bozak the kraul"],"description":"Undead fungal kraul and servant of Mazirek in the Golgari Swarm; a mushroom harvester turned lich's apprentice.","pages":2,"first_seen":"2018-11-07","last_seen":"2018-11-07","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Bozak","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Bozak","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Bozak","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Bozak\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e0","era":null,"summary":"Bozak, harvesting rare mushrooms on the family farmstead, hears the undercity news that a new lich seeks an apprentice skilled at mushroom identification.","participants":["bozak","the-lich","razi"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":3,"quote":"the lich is seeking an apprentice with a proficiency in mushroom identification and a keen interest in necromancy.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=the%20lich%20is%20seeking,keen%20interest%20in%20necromancy.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=the%20lich%20is%20seeking,keen%20interest%20in%20necromancy.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e1","era":null,"summary":"Bozak explains why he wants to be a necromancer and sneaks away from his siblings and Mother's carapace to enter the contest.","participants":["bozak","razi"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"I pack my maps, my journals, my vials, and my harvester's satchel and sneak away while my siblings lie dreaming.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=I%20pack%20my%20maps%2C,my%20siblings%20lie%20dreaming.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=I%20pack%20my%20maps%2C,my%20siblings%20lie%20dreaming.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e2","era":null,"summary":"The lich starts a contest for twenty-six competitors to retrieve four of the most dangerous mushrooms in Ravnica, handing out maps.","participants":["the-lich","bozak","zegodonis"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"Only one of you will be deemed skillful enough to serve as my apprentice,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=Only%20one%20of%20you,serve%20as%20my%20apprentice%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=Only%20one%20of%20you,serve%20as%20my%20apprentice%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e3","era":null,"summary":"Zegodonis bumps Bozak and tears his map; Bozak then spots woodwraiths in the mangrove and warns a few others, who escape while the rest are killed.","participants":["bozak","zegodonis","kata","limin"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":19,"quote":"We hear the creaking of old branches and the suck of roots pulling up from waterlogged soil.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=We%20hear%20the%20creaking,up%20from%20waterlogged%20soil.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=We%20hear%20the%20creaking,up%20from%20waterlogged%20soil.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e4","era":null,"summary":"Bozak meets the kraul Limin and the gorgon Kata, collects zombie fungus, and makes a temporary truce with Limin.","participants":["bozak","limin","kata"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":36,"quote":"If we share information and resources, we can all but guarantee a kraul will win.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=If%20we%20share%20information,a%20kraul%20will%20win.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=If%20we%20share%20information,a%20kraul%20will%20win.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e5","era":null,"summary":"An elf competitor punctures his zombie fungus, is overtaken by spores and climbs a tree to die as a host.","participants":["bozak","limin"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":43,"quote":"The elf chooses a tree and scales it like his body had been built for this sole purpose.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=The%20elf%20chooses%20a,for%20this%20sole%20purpose.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=The%20elf%20chooses%20a,for%20this%20sole%20purpose.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e6","era":null,"summary":"Bozak collects devouring angel mushrooms from a mossdog den while Limin spreads his scent; Limin throws a rock and wakes the dogs and flies off.","participants":["bozak","limin","kata"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":53,"quote":"tossing a rock into the mossdog den","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=tossing%20a%20rock%20into%20the%20mossdog%20den","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=tossing%20a%20rock%20into%20the%20mossdog%20den","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e7","era":null,"summary":"Bozak and Kata team up against the mossdogs; Kata petrifies them but also kills nearly a hundred of Bozak's locusts.","participants":["bozak","kata"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":63,"quote":"The third mossdog turns into a statue, and with it, nearly a hundred locusts.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=The%20third%20mossdog%20turns,nearly%20a%20hundred%20locusts.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=The%20third%20mossdog%20turns,nearly%20a%20hundred%20locusts.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e8","era":null,"summary":"Kata tries to petrify Bozak, and he stabs her in the stomach with his staff carved from Mother's leg.","participants":["bozak","kata"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":66,"quote":"I move fast, thrust the staff forward. It catches the gorgon in the stomach.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=I%20move%20fast%2C%20thrust,gorgon%20in%20the%20stomach.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=I%20move%20fast%2C%20thrust,gorgon%20in%20the%20stomach.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e9","era":null,"summary":"Riding a deadbridge goliath, Bozak races back while the surviving Zegodonis ambushes Limin and steals his satchel; Bozak reaches the lich first.","participants":["bozak","limin","zegodonis","the-lich"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":69,"quote":"He batters Limin as he passes, breaking off two legs and part of a wing.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=He%20batters%20Limin%20as,part%20of%20a%20wing.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=He%20batters%20Limin%20as,part%20of%20a%20wing.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e10","era":null,"summary":"The lich declares both Bozak and Zegodonis his apprentices, though he favors Zegodonis.","participants":["the-lich","bozak","zegodonis"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":72,"quote":"And both of you shall serve under me.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=And%20both%20of%20you%20shall%20serve%20under%20me.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=And%20both%20of%20you%20shall%20serve%20under%20me.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e11","era":null,"summary":"Months later Bozak tends zombies and learns that Boros officers have been exposed to zombie fungus, and Vraska fears Boros will use it to infiltrate the undercity.","participants":["bozak","benzi","vraska","boros-legion"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":76,"quote":"Three high-ranking Boros officers were exposed to the same type of zombie fungus we had been asked to gather.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=Three%20high%2Dranking%20Boros%20officers,been%20asked%20to%20gather.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=Three%20high%2Dranking%20Boros%20officers,been%20asked%20to%20gather.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e12","era":null,"summary":"Alone in the lich's sanctum, Bozak tries a death spell for the first time on a rat corpse.","participants":["bozak"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":78,"quote":"I practice the movements I've seen the lich do","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=I%20practice%20the%20movements,seen%20the%20lich%20do","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=I%20practice%20the%20movements,seen%20the%20lich%20do","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e13","era":null,"summary":"Hiding in a nook, Bozak overhears the lich telling Boros soldiers that he planted a devouring angel mushroom on Vraska's gown to frame her for the Tin Street massacre.","participants":["bozak","the-lich","boros-legion","vraska","tin-street-massacre"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":87,"quote":"Boros will have no choice but to charge Vraska with murder.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=Boros%20will%20have%20no,charge%20Vraska%20with%20murder.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=Boros%20will%20have%20no,charge%20Vraska%20with%20murder.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e15","era":null,"summary":"Bozak reanimates the rat for the first time and uses it to bite the lich, creating a distraction so he can flee to warn Vraska.","participants":["bozak","the-lich"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":95,"quote":"then takes a chomp on the lich's ankle.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=then%20takes%20a%20chomp%20on%20the%20lich%27s%20ankle.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=then%20takes%20a%20chomp%20on%20the%20lich%27s%20ankle.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Death's Precious Moments\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07-e16","era":null,"summary":"Bozak reaches the Hanging Keep and consumes zombie fungus to lose his fear and climb seven stories to Vraska.","participants":["bozak","hanging-keep"],"location":"hanging-keep","importance":"major","page":"stories/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","order":674,"story_date":"2018-11-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":102,"quote":"I pull a zombie fungus sample from my satchel and place it on my tongue.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07#:~:text=I%20pull%20a%20zombie,it%20on%20my%20tongue.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Death's Precious Moments","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/deaths-precious-moments-2018-11-07","l